# inc-q04n control: a Priest with no holy symbol equipped still cannot cast a
# divine spell. Read by tools/check_mage_cast_nobook.sh. This must read the same
# before and after the arcane spellbook requirement is removed.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/xsummon-priest-seed5-opt0822.sav \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/priest-cast-nosymbol.keys 1
#
# THE CHARACTER. Holg, the frozen Orc Priest of Aiswin. His Holy symbol of
# Aiswin hangs in the Neck slot (inventory row o). Creature::HasHolySymbol
# (src/Skills.cpp) reads only the equipment slots.
#
# WHY BLESS. A level-1 divine spell (SP_DIVINE) in his cast menu that asks for
# no target, so the cast reaches the component test at once.
#
# THE ROUTE (each @dump label is one assertion screen in the check):
#   1. 'i', 'o', 'd' drops the symbol out of the Neck slot.   symbol-gone
#   2. 'm', Bless. The refusal is on screen and in the log.   after-cast, msgs

s                       # one real turn: this counts as a session
i
o
d
@dump:symbol-gone
ESC
@until "Things in View" ESC

m
@choose "Bless"
@dump:after-cast
v
@dump:msgs
ESC
@dump:end
